lisa-design:
- Stdlib only, no cobra: keeps go.sum empty so `go install ...@<ver>` from mock plugin workflows is fast and has no dependency drift for ccf-bump to trip over.
- CLI version resolution order: goreleaser ldflags (-X main.version) > module version from debug.ReadBuildInfo (set by `go install ...@<ver>`) > "dev". The go install path is what the mock plugins exercise, so it must report the pinned tag.
- Config file is .goreleaser.yaml (spec), not gooci's misspelled .gorelreaser.yml; archives use goreleaser v2 `formats:` list.
- Builds linux+darwin x amd64+arm64, CGO disabled, mirroring gooci's goos set.
- No GitHub workflows in this PR (release workflow is a later task).

